    "name": "Deload Block — 5-Day Recovery Rotation",
    "description": "RUN THIS between phases or every 5-6 iterations of any main phase (~10-12 calendar weeks of training). Half the working sets, 60% of your normal seed loads, RPE 5-6 (leave 4-5 reps in reserve). 5 days total, then restart the main phase. Non-negotiable for advanced lifters — dropping loads for 1 week beats losing 3 weeks to injury or overreaching. Set app Progression Profile to CONSERVATIVE for this program. [Recommended app setting after import → Program Detail → Progression Profile = CONSERVATIVE.]",
    "daysPerWeek": 5,
    "type": "custom",
    "progressionProfile": "conservative",
    "progressionProfileReason": "Deload = deliberate under-stimulation. Zero pressure to add load."
  },
